    Daily download count history
    Switch NoriHub links to https://norihub.org when it goes live


Commit messages
---------------

  Follow Conventional Commits.
    feat: summary         new feature
    fix: summary          bug fix
    refactor / style / chore / docs / test
  Keep the summary under 50 characters, in English, with no trailing period.


